{"Name":"Chuan Grove (1H2025)","ShortName":"Chuan Grove (1H2025)","Description":"The Chuan Grove site offers 156,231 sqft of prime land in District 19, and has the potential yield round 505 residential units. Within a 5-minute stroll will take you to Lorong Chuan MRT, and as the area continues to attract interest from both HDB upgraders and investors, this reaffirms its strength among buyers seeking lifestyle, convenience and long-term growth. ","StartUrl":"/","Display":"standalone","BackgroundColor":"#ffffff","ThemeColor":"#041e42","Orientation":"portrait","Icons":[{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/7a6e21dd-2ae4-4dad-8b5f-06a9baa93b79","Sizes":"192x192","Type":"image/png"},{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/7a6e21dd-2ae4-4dad-8b5f-06a9baa93b79","Sizes":"512x512","Type":"image/png"}]}